msgstr "A soft round whose size follows the pen's pressure while its color stays whole, for an edge that softens along its length, a cast shadow's from the object out."

msgid "A soft spray that keeps flowing while the pen rests, thicker under pressure. It paints in a mixing blend mode where a mixing module is installed, so over another colour it mixes as paint does, blue over yellow turning green."
msgstr "A soft spray that keeps flowing while the pen rests, thicker under pressure. It paints in a mixing blend mode where a mixing module is installed, so over another color it mixes as paint does, blue over yellow turning green."

msgid "A soft wash through the paper's grain that stops at its opacity however often a stroke crosses itself, so a passage laid in one pass is one even tint, for watercolour and ink washes."
msgstr "A soft wash through the paper's grain that stops at its opacity however often a stroke crosses itself, so a passage laid in one pass is one even tint, for watercolor and ink washes."

