msgstr "A turn of the hue ring keeps the color's lightness and its distance from gray, where the hue allows."

msgid "A wide soft brush with very little flow, so colour builds in thin layers a stroke at a time."
msgstr "A wide soft brush with very little flow, so color builds in thin layers a stroke at a time."

