msgid "Convert this document to 16-bit float, half precision? Every colour keeps its value to the precision of a half float, "
msgstr "Convert this document to 16-bit float, half precision? Every color keeps its value to the precision of a half float, "

msgid "Convert this document to 16-bit float, half precision? Every colour keeps its value to the precision of a half float, the file gets smaller by about half, and the old chunks are held for the undo. A value smaller than about 0.00000006 becomes zero, which loses precision and not range."
