msgstr "How fast a highlight past the knee loses Oklab chroma. 0 keeps the color, higher goes white."

msgid "How hard the tip's round edge is: at 100 it is hard, and lower starts its fade nearer the centre. "
msgstr "How hard the tip's round edge is: at 100 it is hard, and lower starts its fade nearer the center. "

msgid "How hard the tip's round edge is: at 100 it is hard, and lower starts its fade nearer the centre. Hardness above is the edge of the texture's holes, not the tip's."
msgstr "How hard the tip's round edge is: at 100 it is hard, and lower starts its fade nearer the center. Hardness above is the edge of the texture's holes, not the tip's."

