msgstr "How much of a color's chroma survives, over stored value along the bottom: flat up to the knee, then"

msgid "How much of a colour's chroma survives, over stored value along the bottom: flat up to the knee, then falling the faster the further Desaturation is pushed. The dim line is the magnitude, which stays white at white. The dashed mark is the knee."
msgstr "How much of a color's chroma survives, over stored value along the bottom: flat up to the knee, then falling the faster the further Desaturation is pushed. The dim line is the magnitude, which stays white at white. The dashed mark is the knee."

