msgstr "How sharp the edge of the holes the texture leaves is. Low fades paint in around them and thins the grain toward the stroke's edge."

msgid "How the Shape Check view throws the detail away, shown only while that view is on, picked above or from the View menu. Blocks averages the canvas into flat squares. Masses smooths inside each mass and keeps the edges between them where they are, alike at any canvas size. None leaves the picture whole for the posterise below. Grey masses is Masses with the colour gone. Notan is Masses cut into two or three greys, black and white with a middle grey between. Nothing here touches a pixel."
msgstr "How the Shape Check view throws the detail away, shown only while that view is on, picked above or from the View menu. Blocks averages the canvas into flat squares. Masses smooths inside each mass and keeps the edges between them where they are, alike at any canvas size. None leaves the picture whole for the posterize below. Gray masses is Masses with the color gone. Notan is Masses cut into two or three grays, black and white with a middle gray between. Nothing here touches a pixel."

msgid "How the canvas displays colour. Each option is explained when you select it."
msgstr "How the canvas displays color. Each option is explained when you select it."

msgid "How the canvas fills a display wider than the document. Converted shows every colour as it is stored."
msgstr "How the canvas fills a display wider than the document. Converted shows every color as it is stored."

msgid "How the canvas fills a display wider than the document. Converted shows every colour as it is stored. Unconverted sends the document's numbers as they are, stretching every colour to the panel's primaries. Even stretch stretches red, green and blue by one Oklab ratio, the largest none of them clips at. The window title shows the last two."
msgstr "How the canvas fills a display wider than the document. Converted shows every color as it is stored. Unconverted sends the document's numbers as they are, stretching every color to the panel's primaries. Even stretch stretches red, green and blue by one Oklab ratio, the largest none of them clips at. The window title shows the last two."

