msgid "Where the roll-off starts. At 1.0, the default, only a colour brighter than the screen can show changes. A lower knee starts the fading earlier, on colours the screen could show as they are. A higher one leaves a colour just past white nearly as the screen shows it with the roll-off off and holds the ratios more the nearer the knee it stands, all of them from the knee on. No grey and no white moves."
